# tldv_downloader requires NO environment variables.
#
# Authentication is a bearer token you copy from your browser's DevTools while
# signed in to tldv.io, and paste when the script prompts for it. It is never
# read from the environment and is never written to disk.
#
# (Earlier versions of this file described cookie-based auth and listed two n8n
# variables. Neither was accurate: the script reads no environment variables at
# all, and the auth is a pasted bearer token, not a cookie.)
